## Receiver (engine 3) LTP config.
##
## Mirrored ring names: node 3's TX is 'ring_3to2' (node 2 opens it as RX);
## node 3's RX is 'ring_2to3' (the same ring node 2's xlso writes to).
##
## Receiver runs with larger session caps (200/200) than the sender's 8/8,
## matching the asymmetric setup bench-ltp uses so the receiver never
## under-provisions reassembly.
1 200
a span 2 200 200 64000 1000000 1 'xlso shm:ring_3to2 2'
s 'xlsi shm:ring_2to3'
